# Keep the deployment upload to the frontend's own tree.
#
# Every pattern is anchored with a leading slash, and that is load-bearing: an
# unanchored `src/` matches at any depth, so it eats frontend/src/ as well as
# this repository's Python src/. That failed a build with "Failed to resolve
# /src/main.tsx" -- the app's own source had been filtered out from under it.
#
# Only the genuinely large trees are listed. Vercel applies this file to git
# builds as well as CLI uploads, so anything named here is invisible to the
# build, and a shorter list has less to get wrong.
/data/
/.venv/
*.log
